{"ref":"BDB, שְׁבַנְיָה(וּ)","hw":"שְׁבַנְיָה(וּ)","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁבַנְיָה(וּ)</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  -<span dir=\"rtl\">יָה</span>: <strong>a.</strong>  Levites, (1) <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:4\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.4\">Ne 9:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:5\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.5\">5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:13\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.13\">10:13</a>, (2) <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:11\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.11\">10:11</a>; Σεβανια, Σαβανια(ς). <strong>b.</strong>  priest <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:5\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.5\">Ne 10:5</a>, priestly family <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:14\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.14\">12:14</a> (𝔊L Σεχενια), = <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁכַנְיָה</span> v <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:3\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.3\">3</a> (Σεχενια(ς)), and perhaps <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁכַנְיָהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.11\">1 Ch 24:11</a> (Ισχανια, Σεχενια).<br><strong>2.</strong>  -<span dir=\"rtl\">יָהוּ</span>, priest, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.24\">1 Ch 15:24</a> (Σομνια, 𝔊L Σαβανια).","next":"BDB, שׁבס","prev":"BDB, שֶׁבְנָא"}